<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spacebelow="4" spaceabove="8"><Font style="2D Input" executable="false">Generalized Forces: </Font><Equation executable="false" style="2D Comment" input-equation="">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2I1EhRictRiM2I0YrRis=</Equation><Font style="2D Input" executable="false">'s</Font></Text-field></Title>
<Text-field style="Normal" layout="Normal"><Font style="2D Input" executable="false">The non-conservative forces corresponding to the generalized coordinates are: </Font><Equation executable="false" style="2D Comment" input-equation="">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2I1EhRictRiM2I0YrRis=</Equation><Font style="2D Input" executable="false">and the viscous damping forces, where</Font></Text-field>
<Text-field style="Normal" layout="Normal"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Comment" input-equation="">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2I1EhRictRiM2I0YrRis=</Equation><Font style="2D Input" executable="false"> = Current to motor 1, which generates a force on the bottom platform, </Font><Equation executable="false" style="2D Input" input-equation="">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2I1EhRictRiM2I0YrRis=</Equation></Text-field>
<Text-field style="Normal" layout="Normal"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2I1EhRictRiM2I0YrRis=</Equation><Font style="2D Input" executable="false"> = Current to motor 2, which generates a force between the top and middle platform., </Font><Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2I1EhRictRiM2I0YrRis=</Equation><Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2I1EhRictRiM2I0YrRis=</Equation></Text-field>
<Text-field style="2D Input" executable="false" layout="Normal"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Input" input-equation="">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2I1EhRictRiM2I0YrRis=</Equation><Font executable="false">= tire dashpot viscous damping coefficient</Font></Text-field>
<Text-field style="2D Input" executable="false" layout="Normal"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Input" input-equation="">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2I1EhRictRiM2I0YrRis=</Equation><Font executable="false">= suspension strut dashpot viscous damping coefficient</Font></Text-field>
